      "textContent": "Welcome to Eyad Drive - Secure Cloud Storage & AI Workspace!\n\nKEY FEATURES IN THIS APP:\n• Admin Account: Eyad.Eliwa (Unlimited Storage, System Control)\n• Storage Plans:\n   - Free (15 GB)\n   - Pro (250 GB)\n   - Ultimate (450 GB)\n   - Ultimate Pro (1 TB)\n   - Admin Unlimited (Infinite)\n• Cross-Device Synchronization:\n   Upload files from any device/browser, then sign in with the same account from another device to access and preview them!\n• Instant File Previews:\n   Preview images, PDFs, code, text, video, and audio directly in the browser.\n• Gemini AI Drive Copilot:\n   Ask questions, search documents, or get storage recommendations using the AI Chat panel.\n• Star & Search:\n   Star important files and instantly filter by name, category, or date.",
